EVALUATION DATA
================================================================================

All pages used for evaluation in this repository are generated by
forgesight/synth/generator.py and are licensed CC0-1.0 / public domain
dedication by their generator. They contain no third-party content: the text is
assembled from a small in-repo vocabulary, the figures are drawn procedurally,
and the fonts are the ones bundled with ReportLab.

Every generated page is visibly and metadata-marked as SYNTHETIC.

No real document, no DocLayNet page and no employer data is used anywhere in this
repository.

